        "text_preview": " This is a Civil Revision Petition filed under Article 227 of the Constitution of India for setting aside / modification the order dated 20.09.2024 passed by the Additional Civil Judge (Sr.Div.), Ferozepur Jhirka in R.P no.2 of 2020 titled "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f214e4ce5ce24e908cf2c4c5d3ba9bf6_13",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
