        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Keeping in view the above said facts and circumstances, this Court is of the opinion that the impugned order is in accordance with law and deserves to be upheld and the petition filed by the petitioner being meritless and deserves to be dis"
      }
